      "name": "Karin the Celestial Sage of the Highest Heights",
      "effect": "2 Level 7 monsters\nWhen your opponent activates a card or effect that includes an effect that Special Summons a monster(s) from the Deck (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card; your opponent draws 1 card, then negate that activated effect, and if you do, destroy that card. During your Main Phase 2: You can target 1 Level 7 monster in your GY; take damage equal to its ATK, and if you do, return both it and this card on the field to the hand/Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Karin the Celestial Sage of the Highest Heights\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
